  "summary": "A radar screen groups detected points into the four compass quadrants. Count how many points lie in each region according to the coordinate axes and the exercise’s boundary rules. Group two-dimensional points into compass quadrants.",
  "durationMinutes": 20,
  "functionName": "countQuadrants",
  "requirements": [
    "Positive Y means north, positive X means east.",
